    "title": "Crash with injuries reported in High Point on Skeet Club Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "HIGH POINT, N.C. (WGHP) — A crash with injuries was reported in High Point on Wednesday night, according to the High Point Police Department. The crash happened on Skeet Club Road around 9 p.m. First responders are still on the scene. The extent of the injuries is unknown. Police say people were taken to a hospital. The cause of the crash is also unknown. This is a developing story. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX8 WGHP.",
